# React Frontend Rules

## UI Principles
- Guided, step-based wizard for tenant admin
- Progressive disclosure: overrides/advanced only when needed
- Real-time reactive: Convex useQuery drives live progress
- Actions close to data (bulk send, resend, approve/reject from tables)

## Component Patterns
- Use shadcn/ui components as base
- Validate forms with Zod + react-hook-form
- Loading states: use Skeleton components while Convex queries resolve
- Empty states: always handle "no data yet" gracefully
- Error boundaries on all route-level components

## Mock Auth
- Role switcher in top nav (Vend Admin / Tenant Admin)
- Use React context to provide current role
- Gate views based on role, not real authentication
